[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":107},["ShallowReactive",2],{"header-locale:\u002Farchives\u002Fpage\u002F21\u002F":3,"archive-page:zh-Hant:21":4,"author-stats:zh-Hant:full":105},null,{"posts":5,"total":103,"totalPages":104},[6,15,29,40,52,61,70,78,88,96],{"url":7,"title":8,"date":9,"updated":9,"category":10,"tags":11,"description":13,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fhtml\u002F20230526\u002F2927853444\u002F","淺談 HTML 究竟是不是程式語言？","2023-05-26 23:16:05","HTML",[10,12],"程式語言","有些人會說 HTML 是程式語言，但也有人說 HTMl 不是程式語言，所以這一篇就來淺談一下 HTML 究竟是不是程式語言~","2",{"url":16,"title":17,"date":18,"updated":18,"category":19,"tags":20,"description":27,"readingMinutes":28},"\u002Fother\u002F20230520\u002F2118016719\u002F","或許你該懂一下 CI\u002FCD？用 CD 部署到 Render.com","2023-05-20 22:28:04","雜談",[21,22,23,24,25,26],"CI\u002FCD","GitHub Actions","Render.com","Express","ESLint","Jest","身為一名工程師來講，其實稍微懂一點 CI\u002FCD 是滿有幫助的，畢竟如果想要做一點小專案之類的，那麼 CI\u002FCD 是可以派上一些用場，就算你只是一名前端工程師，也可以善加利用 CI\u002FCD 來做一些事情。","11",{"url":30,"title":31,"date":32,"updated":32,"category":19,"tags":33,"description":38,"readingMinutes":39},"\u002Fother\u002F20230518\u002F2131851751\u002F","Demo 的時候機子睡著好尷尬怎麼辦？用 UptimeRobot 或 cron-job.org 來幫你吧！","2023-05-18 09:25:53",[34,35,36,37],"Render","UptimeRobot","cron-job.org","休眠","作爲一名工程師，偶爾下班寫寫一些 Side Project 是滿正常不過的事情，而這些東西通常會放在免費的平台上，但是許多平台都有一個共通的問題，就是如果沒有人使用的話，它就會進入休眠狀態，這時候如果有人想要使用的話，就會需要等待一段時間，所以這一篇就會來介紹 UptimeRobot 以及 cron-job.org 這兩個服務。","3",{"url":41,"title":42,"date":43,"updated":43,"category":44,"tags":45,"description":50,"readingMinutes":51},"\u002Finformation-security\u002F20230516\u002F18406287\u002F","Token 放 localStorage？sessionStorage？還是 Cookie？","2023-05-16 16:54:38","資安",[44,46,47,48,49],"JWT","localStorage","Cookie","XSS","這一篇文章來分享與記錄一下關於 JWT Token 的一些事情，以及為什麼不要把 JWT Token 放在 localStorage。","6",{"url":53,"title":54,"date":55,"updated":55,"category":56,"tags":57,"description":60,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20230516\u002F1249700747\u002F","讓同事進入混亂貓咪的假 jQuery 技巧","2023-05-